<title>INDONESIA: JIHD says 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>JIHD says 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 23.9   vs   12.86</p>
<p>    Revenues				  100.64  vs   95.05</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	   37    vs    33</p>
<p>    Gross profit			     48.82  vs   61.44</p>
<p>    Income from operations		  1.74  vs    6.88</p>
<p>    Other income			     30.84  vs   15.25</p>
<p>    Minority interest			(0.12) vs    0.02</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     157.95  vs  137.91</p>
<p>Note: The results were audited. PT Jakarta International Hotels and Development is a property developer and hotel operator.</p>
</text>
